Node ID=200 irish
Text=My accent is odd, is it? Sure'n you should listen to yerself? Alas, Ireland, the land I am from, is no more, sank some three hundred years ago during the troubled times. To my people, our home is the ocean. Some of us have come to Spain to join Armada and help sail their galleys for a good wage - but the English, we fight them for free! <Laughs>
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
